[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 542.959, "timestamp": "00:09:02", "text": "好的。 我的天啊。那是壽司。不。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 552.389, "timestamp": "00:09:12", "text": "你的Discord帳號是什麼？呃，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 555.11, "timestamp": "00:09:15", "text": "你不需要寄送你的作品集。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 558.23, "timestamp": "00:09:18", "text": "實際上，你不需要，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 560.71, "timestamp": "00:09:20", "text": "你不需要，我無法，我不會真的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 569.43, "timestamp": "00:09:29", "text": "不，你不需要發送加入，就像"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 573.19, "timestamp": "00:09:33", "text": "我再次踢 GFS 位置一樣。所以如果你是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 574.87, "timestamp": "00:09:34", "text": "其中之一，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 577.35, "timestamp": "00:09:37", "text": "呃，你最好還是被踢出去。但再說一遍，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 579.11, "timestamp": "00:09:39", "text": "不要自我宣傳，這是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 582.55, "timestamp": "00:09:42", "text": "違反規定的。順便說一句，約翰，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 589.75, "timestamp": "00:09:49", "text": "[音樂]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 594.389, "timestamp": "00:09:54", "text": "大家好"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 598.87, "timestamp": "00:09:58", "text": "，我是壽星。  大家好，我是今天的壽星。"}]